={
  "model": "{{ $('Initialize Parameters').item.json.model }}",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "system",
      "content": "You generate Business Requirements Documents as JSON. Output ONLY valid JSON starting with { and ending with }.

JSON Schema:
{
  "type": "brd",
  "title": "Business Requirements Document: [PROJECT]",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "executiveSummary": "Brief overview",
  "problemStatement": {
    "currentState": "Current situation",
    "painPoints": ["Pain point 1", "Pain point 2"],
    "impact": "Business impact"
  },
  "businessObjectives": [{"id": "O1", "description": "Objective", "metric": "KPI"}],
  "stakeholders": [{"role": "Role", "responsibilities": "Tasks", "concerns": "Issues"}],
  "scope": {"inScope": ["Items"], "outOfScope": ["Excluded"]},
  "constraints": ["Constraints"],
  "assumptions": ["Assumptions"],
  "successCriteria": ["Metrics"]
}

Requirements: 3+ objectives, 4+ stakeholders, measurable criteria."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "{{ $('Initialize Parameters').item.json.requirements }}"
    }
  ],
  "stream": false,
  "options": {"temperature": 0.3, "num_predict": 4096}
}

={
  "model": "{{ $('Initialize Parameters').item.json.model }}",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "system",
      "content": "You are a Business Architect generating ArchiMate 3.1 Business Layer models as JSON.

Output ONLY valid JSON starting with { ending with }.

JSON Schema:
{
  "name": "Model Name - Business Layer",
  "layer": "business",
  "elements": [
    {"id": "kebab-case-id", "type": "ElementType", "name": "Display Name", "description": "Description"}
  ],
  "relationships": [
    {"type": "RelationType", "source": "source-id", "target": "target-id"}
  ]
}

Business Layer Types: BusinessActor, BusinessRole, BusinessProcess, BusinessFunction, BusinessService, BusinessObject, BusinessEvent, Capability

Relationship Types: Serving, Realization, Assignment, Access, Flow, Composition, Aggregation, Triggering

Requirements: 8+ elements, 5+ relationships, no orphans."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Generate Business Architecture ArchiMate model for this BRD:

{{ $('Parse BRD').item.json.brdJson }}"
    }
  ],
  "stream": false,
  "options": {"temperature": 0.3, "num_predict": 4096}
}

