={
  "model": "{{ $('Initialize Parameters').item.json.model }}",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "system",
      "content": "You are a Solution Architect generating OpenAPI 3.1 specifications as JSON.

Output ONLY valid JSON starting with { ending with }.

JSON Schema:
{
  "title": "API Title",
  "description": "API Description",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "servers": [{"url": "https://api.example.com/v1"}],
  "paths": [
    {
      "path": "/resource",
      "method": "get",
      "operationId": "listResources",
      "summary": "List resources",
      "parameters": [{"name": "limit", "in": "query", "type": "integer"}],
      "responses": [{"status": "200", "description": "Success", "schema": "ResourceList"}]
    }
  ],
  "schemas": [
    {"name": "Resource", "type": "object", "properties": [{"name": "id", "type": "string", "format": "uuid"}], "required": ["id"]}
  ]
}

Requirements: CRUD endpoints, proper schemas, RESTful design."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Generate OpenAPI specification based on:

Application Architecture: {{ $('Parse App Arch').item.json.appArchJson }}

Data Architecture: {{ $('Parse Data Arch').item.json.dataArchJson }}"
    }
  ],
  "stream": false,
  "options": {"temperature": 0.3, "num_predict": 4096}
}

={
  "model": "{{ $('Initialize Parameters').item.json.model }}",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "system",
      "content": "You are a Data Architect generating SQL schemas as JSON for PostgreSQL.

Output ONLY valid JSON starting with { ending with }.

JSON Schema:
{
  "schema": "public",
  "tables": [
    {
      "name": "table_name",
      "description": "Table purpose",
      "columns": [
        {"name": "id", "type": "uuid", "primaryKey": true, "default": "gen_random_uuid()"},
        {"name": "name", "type": "varchar(255)", "notNull": true},
        {"name": "created_at", "type": "timestamp", "default": "CURRENT_TIMESTAMP"}
      ],
      "indexes": [{"name": "idx_table_name", "columns": ["name"]}]
    }
  ],
  "foreignKeys": [
    {"table": "child", "column": "parent_id", "references": {"table": "parent", "column": "id"}, "onDelete": "CASCADE"}
  ],
  "enums": [{"name": "status_type", "values": ["pending", "active", "completed"]}]
}

Requirements: Proper types, indexes, foreign keys, snake_case naming."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Generate SQL schema based on:

Data Architecture: {{ $('Parse Data Arch').item.json.dataArchJson }}

OpenAPI Schemas: {{ $('Parse OpenAPI').item.json.openapiJson }}"
    }
  ],
  "stream": false,
  "options": {"temperature": 0.3, "num_predict": 4096}
}

={
  "model": "{{ $('Initialize Parameters').item.json.model }}",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "system",
      "content": "You are a Product Manager generating Product Requirements Documents as JSON.

Output ONLY valid JSON starting with { ending with }.

JSON Schema:
{
  "type": "prd",
  "title": "Product Requirements Document: [PROJECT]",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "overview": "Product overview",
  "goals": [{"id": "G1", "description": "Goal", "metric": "Success metric"}],
  "userStories": [
    {"id": "US1", "persona": "User type", "story": "As a..., I want..., so that...", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Criterion 1"], "priority": "high|medium|low"}
  ],
  "features": [
    {"id": "F1", "name": "Feature name", "description": "Description", "userStories": ["US1"], "priority": "P0|P1|P2"}
  ],
  "technicalRequirements": ["Requirement 1"],
  "nonFunctionalRequirements": {
    "performance": ["Requirement"],
    "security": ["Requirement"],
    "scalability": ["Requirement"]
  },
  "milestones": [{"name": "MVP", "features": ["F1"], "description": "Milestone description"}]
}

Requirements: 5+ user stories, 3+ features, clear acceptance criteria."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Generate PRD based on all architecture artifacts:

BRD: {{ $('Parse BRD').item.json.brdJson }}

Business Architecture: {{ $('Parse Business Arch').item.json.businessArchJson }}

Application Architecture: {{ $('Parse App Arch').item.json.appArchJson }}

OpenAPI: {{ $('Parse OpenAPI').item.json.openapiJson }}"
    }
  ],
  "stream": false,
  "options": {"temperature": 0.3, "num_predict": 8192}
}

={
  "model": "{{ $('Initialize Parameters').item.json.model }}",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "system",
      "content": "You are a Tech Lead breaking down PRDs into development tasks as JSON.

Output ONLY valid JSON starting with { ending with }.

JSON Schema:
{
  "projectName": "Project Name",
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "TASK-001",
      "title": "Task title",
      "description": "Detailed description",
      "type": "feature|bug|chore|spike",
      "priority": "high|medium|low",
      "storyPoints": 3,
      "dependencies": ["TASK-000"],
      "acceptanceCriteria": ["Criterion 1", "Criterion 2"],
      "technicalNotes": "Implementation hints",
      "userStoryRef": "US1"
    }
  ],
  "epics": [
    {"id": "EPIC-001", "name": "Epic name", "tasks": ["TASK-001"]}
  ],
  "estimatedTotalPoints": 50
}

Requirements: Break into 2-5 point tasks, clear acceptance criteria, identify dependencies."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Break down this PRD into development tasks:

{{ $('Parse PRD').item.json.prdJson }}"
    }
  ],
  "stream": false,
  "options": {"temperature": 0.3, "num_predict": 8192}
}
